 * |                                 |     | GGGG    | Anno Domini, Before Christ        | 2     |
 * |                                 |     | GGGGG   | A, B                              |       |
 * | Calendar year                   | 130 | y       | 44, 1, 1900, 2017, 9999           | 4     |
 * |                                 |     | yo      | 44th, 1st, 1900th, 9999999th      | 4,5   |
 * |                                 |     | yy      | 44, 01, 00, 17                    | 4     |
 * |                                 |     | yyy     | 044, 001, 123, 999                | 4     |
 * |                                 |     | yyyy    | 0044, 0001, 1900, 2017            | 4     |
