 * |                                 |     | pp      | 12:00:00 AM                       |       |
 * | Combination of date and time    |  NA | Pp      | 05/29/1453, 12:00 AM              |       |
 * |                                 |     | PPpp    | May 29, 1453, 12:00:00 AM         |       |
 * |                                 |     | PPPpp   | May 29th, 1453 at ...             |       |
 * |                                 |     | PPPPpp  | Sunday, May 29th, 1453 at ...     | 2,5,8 |
 * Notes:
